1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:06,140
Every indicator has settings you can change. First add one: click Indicators.

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:12,360
Pick Moving Average.

3
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:16,880
It is added with a tag. The gear opens its settings.

4
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:20,710
Period is how many candles it averages. Change 20 to 50 for a smoother line.

5
00:00:20,810 --> 00:00:25,070
You can also pick its colour, the price it uses, and its timeframe.

6
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:29,410
Click Update.

7
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:33,270
The line redraws with the new setting.

8
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:39,240
The eye hides it for a moment. Click again to show it.

9
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:42,690
The X removes it from the chart.

